# Dense state-plane export (unlock ruling 2026-11-10): one uint8 per
# cell instead of per-cell typed messages — the full 1 cm grid reads
# as ~66 pages of 64 KiB instead of ~1060 pages whose per-cell
# CargoMapCellV2 construction costs ~28 us/cell. States are the
# CargoMapCellV2 enum verbatim: 0 unknown, 1 free, 2 occupied. Layout:
# x-fastest row-major over the FULL grid shape (meta.grid):
# idx = ix + sx*(iy + sy*iz). Paged by CELL count along that order
# (limit 0 -> 65536 cells/page, max 262144); region queries are not
# part of this contract yet (INVALID_FILTER). Tokens, cursors and
# release semantics are the CargoMapQueryRequestV2 contract verbatim.
luggage_msgs/CargoMapQueryRequestV2 query
---
luggage_msgs/CargoMapQueryMetaV2 meta
uint8[] states
